      "status": "observed",
      "value": {
        "severity": "low",
        "id": "e2e-binding-omits-files-its-own-assertions-depend-on",
        "detail": "The e2e lane binds the three files it directly runs or imports, but its assertions also depend on the two test files it spawns as children, the six replacement suites named in REPLACEMENT_COVERAGE for ac:2, and the Story markdown that the final test parses and requires to yield exactly six VET criteria. The unit lane independently binds the two spawned files, so docs/management/stories/active/story-vibepro-vacuous-e2e-test-elimination.md is the only load-bearing dependency no lane binds: an edit to its Acceptance Criteria section could invalidate a passing assertion while every record still evaluates as current."
      },
